# CR 616.1: same board as the sibling scenario, but the AI picks Notion Thief
# (index 0) first. It replaces the draw with a draw by the human, an event
# Thought Reflection (the AI's own "You") does not apply to. Thought
# Reflection never sees the AI's draw, which no longer happens.
# Human library 5 - 2 (Words of Wisdom) - 1 (diverted) = 2.
queue replacement 0
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
queue paygeneric U
castspell human 1
resolvestack
